Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:09.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.24,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.45,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好！ 要從哪個開始呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,儘管跟我說吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.00,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,這… 這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.80,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,那就麻煩妳先洗碗好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:19.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,交給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.62,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,剛剛發出了很大的碎裂聲！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:26.54,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,桌子越擦越溼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.34,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,洗好的衣服被疊成了金字塔狀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:35.00,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對… 對不起 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:39.30,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,這… 只是想比平常更努力 才不小心搞砸了對吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.75,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,媽媽都知道的喔 好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:42.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:45.28,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,她這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:47.49,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,突然很有幹勁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:50.59,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,是想跟我撒嬌要加零用錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.46,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,因為常去遊樂場所以手頭緊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:57.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那個… 還有啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.66,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,嗯？ 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:00.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:04.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,等… 等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽！ 謝謝妳總是做飯和打掃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:12.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的非常謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:13.97,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:19.60,Comment,Lily,0,0,0,,※ 日本的母親節位於每年五月第2個星期日（與中文圈相同）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:19.60,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那個… 我聽人說日本的母親節是在五月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:20.80,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.45,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,所以妳前陣子才幫忙做家事的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:28.16,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,是黃水仙…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:32.24,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,在英國 母親節送的不是康乃馨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.66,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,而是比較常送黃水仙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:37.58,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,花語是「尊敬」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.09,0:01:42.00,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.59,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,是故鄉的香氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:48.53,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,不過我可不會輕易幫妳加零用錢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:51.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我… 我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.83,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,畢竟妳也只是幫忙而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:55.26,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.97,Comment,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,※ 日本的父親節位於每年六月第3個星期日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.97,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,也別忘了「父親節」喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:38.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這樣啊？ 妳媽媽很高興吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:39.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:41.11,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:45.05,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這也是多虧蓮司你告訴我母親節的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:47.62,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:50.03,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,果然還是下起雨了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:50.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:58.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,唉 看來短時間內不會停了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:03.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 莉莉 妳該不會沒帶傘？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:04.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.49,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Just, moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:14.51,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,來 如果不嫌棄的話請用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那蓮司你怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:18.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:21.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我用那邊的備用傘就… 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.59,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,先搶先贏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.28,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,抱歉啦 蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:33.10,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,送我回家！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.29,0:04:33.10,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Escort me home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:35.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我們一起走 你送我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.29,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,護花使者先生
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.29,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mister Escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:40.96,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 我還要打工
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:41.72,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我等你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.29,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這裡很好打發時間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:47.39,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那我先去玩囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:49.44,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 不對！ 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:54.68,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 難道是要我送莉莉回家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:58.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真… 真的假的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:05.09,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,為了拿到那個公仔我花了五千圓耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:05.91,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.51,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,但我一點都不後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:29.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對話 對話…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對了 莉莉家住在哪一帶啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,離這裡沒有很遠嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:39.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不靠過來一點會淋濕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:40.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:43.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳還好嗎 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.27,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有沒有哪裡受傷？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真的嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:05.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是嗎… 太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.32,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喂 你們兩個！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:08.54,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:12.42,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,車裡的人好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:15.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 看來沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:17.92,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,是嗎… 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.40,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.40,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,爸… 爸？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.65,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Da... ddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.14,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.14,Text-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是莉莉的爸爸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.64,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喔 原來是莉莉啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.64,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.97,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,突然跑到馬路上很危險！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.97,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Don't dash out onto the street like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:30.77,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對不起嘛 爸爸！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.97,0:06:30.77,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,HAHA Dad! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:36.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦…？ 真的是她爸爸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我來介紹一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司 他是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.17,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那麼… 既然莉莉看起來也沒事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:53.88,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我就先告辭了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:55.67,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.57,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這樣對女兒的救命恩人太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:00.86,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,能否到我家來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.87,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,讓我好好招待你一番？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:05.58,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,沒事 就在附近而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.57,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,可以吧 蓮司君？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:10.90,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好… 好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.76,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對啊蓮司！ 來嘛來嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:17.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 哈… 哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.63,High,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽 我回來了 媽媽？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.63,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm back, Mum. Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:29.09,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,我有聽到！ 歡迎回來 怎… 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.21,0:07:29.09,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,I heard you! Glad you're home. Oh, wha-? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.68,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,嗯？ 回來路上剛好碰到
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.68,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Hmm? We just ran into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.80,High,Lily,0,0,0,,對啊 回來路上剛好碰到
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.80,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah, we just ran into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃… 打擾了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.35,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,哎呀 歡迎你 蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.20,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,什麼？ 妳認識他嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:40.77,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.03,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,之前碰巧遇到過
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.03,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,We just ran into him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.43,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,今天剛好煮了咖哩真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:52.19,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,這樣就算突然多一個人也沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:55.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 我只是因為下雨才送她回家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不用這麼費心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.94,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,哎呀 不用這麼客氣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:00.94,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.94,0:08:00.94,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:05.41,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,你看？ 莉莉也想在蓮司君面前好好表現一番呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.12,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,對吧 莉莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.96,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,之前有練習幫忙做家事真是太好了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.96,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're getting something out of the chores you did the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.25,High,Lily,0,0,0,,吼！ 媽媽 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.77,0:08:19.15,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喔 那正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:23.39,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你來這邊幫忙削蘋果皮好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:27.23,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,順便來聊些男人之間的話題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:28.74,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好… 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉絕對是像媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:35.79,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是說 那把刀是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:38.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不管怎麼看都不是削水果用的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.08,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,差不多準備好了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.08,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,I suppose this'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:43.29,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,好了 能幫我準備盤子嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.08,0:08:43.29,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Right then, can you prepare the plates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.50,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.50,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.71,High,Lily,0,0,0,,這些可以嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.71,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Are these fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.92,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,喂！ 不要那樣甩來甩去的！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.92,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go waving them around like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.63,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我不會弄掉的 沒事啦
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.63,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna drop it. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.28,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,小心一點啦 莉莉
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.28,Text-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Just be careful, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.53,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:59.42,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你是在莉莉常去的那家遊樂場當店員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:00.76,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:05.02,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,那個… 她在那裡的狀況怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:05.90,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:10.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 她每次都玩得很開心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:13.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還會跟學校的朋友一起來玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:16.77,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:21.41,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,最近都不讓我接送了… 原來是這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.53,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,原來如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:29.52,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蓮司君 突然跟你說這些可能會造成你的困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.97,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但她剛來日本的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.58,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,有段時間完全沒交到朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.14,High,Lily,0,0,0,,像這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.14,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:41.80,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,沒錯 妳做得真棒！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.93,0:09:41.80,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Yep, you're doing brilliantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.39,High,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.39,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:46.99,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但自從她開始去遊樂場後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:49.52,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,就會很開心地跟我們分享各種事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.90,High,Lily,0,0,0,,那我再多裝一點！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.90,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Then I suppose I'll put a bit more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.86,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,呃… 不 那樣就夠了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.86,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Uh... no, that's more than plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:56.62,Top,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,喂 這樣就夠了…
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.16,0:09:56.62,Top-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Hey, that's enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:10:00.82,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我很感謝你為她創造了這個契機
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 不！ 這沒什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:08.57,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,因為工作的關係搬來這裡 我一直很擔心她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:11.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,到底是做什麼工作的啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:18.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過… 雖然外表有點那個 但他似乎是個為女兒著想的好爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:19.36,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:19.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:25.35,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,如果是要交往那又另當別論了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 不是！ 不是那樣的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我跟莉莉只是店員和客人的關係而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.49,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.93,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,一個普通的店員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:39.44,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,會在雨天和客人共撐一把傘送回家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.11,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你是這個意思嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:43.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那是因為我同事把雨傘…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:46.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不對… 是因為雨傘只有一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:50.36,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,更何況！ 你們還互相直呼名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:52.74,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這樣還只是店員跟客人嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不是… 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.51,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,那到底是什麼關係？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:10:58.64,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,快從實招來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:02.51,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 呃… 這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.20,High,Lily,0,0,0,,真是的 爸爸 你給我差不多一點！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.20,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Honestly, Dad! Let him be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.89,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,妳做什麼啊 莉莉？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.89,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:13.69,High,Lily,0,0,0,,不用你操心！ 我們不是你想的那種關係！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.98,0:11:13.69,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry! It's not the kind of relationship you're thinking of!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.77,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喔 好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.77,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Oh. All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:18.51,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,嗯…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:19.69,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蛤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.23,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.28,High,Lily,0,0,0,,至少現在還不是
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.28,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,At least not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.64,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我就知道！ 你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.64,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,I knew it! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.85,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你到底有什麼企圖！？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.85,Text-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Just what are you after!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:34.79,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 什麼？ 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.08,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸住手啦！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.08,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Ugh, stop it, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.27,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,莉莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:41.11,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,等等！ 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:44.81,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,好了 大家 晚餐準備好囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.95,Text,Girl,0,0,0,,爸爸！ 那邊那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:09.92,Text,Father,0,0,0,,好！ 看招！ 嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.12,Text,Father,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:13.58,Text,Mother,0,0,0,,好棒喔！ 爸爸 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.10,Text,Father,0,0,0,,爸爸很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.28,Text,Girl,0,0,0,,好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:26.91,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,你看你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:28.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,喔喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:30.69,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳換夏季制服啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,很適合妳 很可愛喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:33.35,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我跟莉莉是在冬天認識的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這樣想想也過了好一段時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.12,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,喔 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.20,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,妳今天要玩什麼遊戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.31,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,想再跟妳切磋…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:46.36,Text,Brown-Haired Guy & Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:47.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.99,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你好啊 店員先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:54.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:55.74,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:59.74,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,怎麼？ 對我沒什麼感想嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:03.89,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？ 不… 那個… 您的穿著很帥氣…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.97,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你這個傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:08.16,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,平常就是這樣對她眉來眼去的嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:08.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.90,High,Lily,0,0,0,,吼！ 你給我適可而止啦！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.90,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Ugh! Just stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 那個 今天有什麼事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.30,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,有事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:20.41,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我休假時要跟女兒去哪裡玩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.77,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,是我的自由吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:26.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,說的也是！ 抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.73,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,那是莉莉的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.15,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,會這麼想也是當然的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.76,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.13,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,會選這裡是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:35.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.25,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我聽說…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:42.91,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這間遊樂場有會對未成年少女出手的混帳大學生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:44.43,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,你說什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,在這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:49.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,竟然有那種…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:55.10,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,如果你做了什麼虧心事…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是 我知道會怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:02.40,High,Lily,0,0,0,,爸爸你夠了喔…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.15,0:14:02.40,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh stop, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:05.19,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我們快點去玩啦！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.07,0:14:05.19,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and start some games!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:09.51,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,說得沒錯 莉莉！ 抱歉！ 讓妳久等了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.65,0:14:09.51,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,That's right, Lily! Sorry! I've kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:13.74,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,不知道妳想玩哪個呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.07,0:14:13.74,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Wonder which one you want to play, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:16.18,High,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 哪個好呢…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.49,0:14:16.18,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Hmm, which one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:20.88,High,Lily,0,0,0,,是新的男子漢無尾熊娃娃！ 就玩這個吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.25,0:14:20.88,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,It's the new Mister Manly Koala plush! Let's do this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:25.00,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這就是所謂的「夾娃娃機」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是… 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:32.76,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我一次就能夾到！ 看好了 爸爸！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.70,0:14:32.76,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll win on the first try! Watch, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:35.06,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,喔！ 真不愧是我女兒！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.97,0:14:35.06,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Oh! That's my girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:38.19,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,一次就… 一次… 一…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:42.72,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,一… 一次就… 嗚嗚…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.06,0:14:44.44,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就知道會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.73,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.62,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這樣榨取金錢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.45,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,還看著客人哭泣並沉浸在愉悅之中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.95,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這就是這間店的真面目嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 這是誤會…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:58.81,Text,Girl,0,0,0,,我夾到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:01.19,Text,Girl,0,0,0,,妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.26,Text,Mother,0,0,0,,哇 妳好棒唷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.81,Text,Girl,0,0,0,,好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:14.20,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,既然這樣 就由我親自出馬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,你知道怎麼操作嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.64,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:24.52,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,雖然沒狩獵過無尾熊 但我曾親手打倒過熊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這人到底在說什麼…？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:32.52,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.67,0:15:32.52,Text-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:40.55,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.56,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我從沒看過這麼沒力的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.88,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這台機器不是用抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:49.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,而是要一點一點把它推下去的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:56.85,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,還真是會耍小聰明…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:22.76,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,明明… 只差一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:26.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 還是放棄比較…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:29.46,High,Lily,0,0,0,,他說得沒錯！ 已經夠了啦 爸爸！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.16,0:16:29.46,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,He's right! You've done enough already, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.51,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,抱歉 莉莉…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.51,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.18,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,爸爸這麼沒用
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.18,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,I'm so uncool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:42.62,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,其實 我也不想就此放棄…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.26,0:16:42.62,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't really wanna give up either...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:44.92,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我也不想 但…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.62,0:16:44.92,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,I don't want to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.42,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我已經沒錢了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.42,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,I'm all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.71,High,Lily,0,0,0,,爸爸 謝謝你…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.71,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:16:59.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,喔 奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:01.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,怎麼會在這種地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這裡掉了一枚硬幣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:06.67,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你這傢伙有何企…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.71,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:09.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:19:00.01,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,{\t(3072,6030,\4c&HFFFFFF&)\t(3072,6030,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.62,Top,Crowd,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:02.67,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,拿去吧… 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:04.00,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.81,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,雖然總算是夾到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:09.00,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但實在不想去算花了多少錢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.83,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,你這傢伙平常都這樣對待我女兒嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 沒有這種事…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:15.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.07,High,Lily,0,0,0,,爸爸 謝謝你幫我夾到！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.07,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks for getting it for me, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:26.51,High,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,啊！ 當然囉！ 只要妳開心 爸爸也會很開心 莉莉！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.76,0:19:26.51,High-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Ah! Of course! I'm happy that you're happy, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:30.98,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,看在莉莉開心的份上 這次就饒了你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.65,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,但沒有下次了 你給我記住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:35.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:37.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,再見囉 蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:39.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,歡迎再次光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:42.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,累死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.52,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:16.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是莉莉的爸爸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,怪了 今天您一個人來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:22.50,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,怎麼 我一個人來不行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:25.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 沒那種事…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:27.65,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這個 還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:28.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,喔 不… 沒關係的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:34.53,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,我才不打算欠你這傢伙人情！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:39.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 您是特地為此而來的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:42.50,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,哼！ 只是順便而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:48.37,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,今天一定要成功抓住你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 那個男子漢無尾熊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,昨天不是已經夾到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:58.64,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,用那種不像樣的方式夾到 我可不承認！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:02.65,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,這次一定… 要由我親手抓住！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:11.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 如果您不嫌棄 要不要我給您點建議？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.21,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,不用你多管閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.41,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,只要用爪子把它推出來就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:19.16,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,哼 只要知道訣竅 這種東西根本…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:20.42,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,一次就…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:21.41,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:22.28,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,一…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我就知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:29.44,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,再來一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:38.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,總覺得… 這種一旦投入就一頭熱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:41.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還有不服輸的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,果然是父女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:50.18,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,氣死我了！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.78,0:21:50.18,Text-English,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,Blooooody heeeeeeell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:01.04,Text,Lily's Dad,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:02.09,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Comment: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:00.02,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
